OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy day for most,
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of light drizzle,
OL,7,Fespecially for eastern parts. The best
OL,8,Fof any brighter or sunnier spells
OL,9,Fexpected across western parts of
OL,10,FPerthshire and Stirlingshire. Mainly
OL,11,Flight easterly or southeasterly winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FContinuing rather cloudy with
OL,14,Fpatchy drizzle, but there will be some
OL,15,Fclearer spells around, especially in
OL,16,Fthe west where patchy fog and perhaps
OL,17,Fa touch of frost may develop.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
